{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reflex-dev/reflex-enterprise/pulls/256","id":4753562606,"node_id":"PR_kwDON3f2aM8AAAABG1Wb7g","html_url":"https://github.com/reflex-dev/reflex-enterprise/pull/256","diff_url":"https://github.com/reflex-dev/reflex-enterprise/pull/256.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/reflex-dev/reflex-enterprise/pull/256.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reflex-dev/reflex-enterprise/issues/256","number":256,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix: complete iframe popup login after cookie sync","user":{"login":"masenf","id":1524005,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MjQwMDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1524005?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masenf","html_url":"https://github.com/masenf","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masenf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masenf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masenf/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masenf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masenf/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masenf/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masenf/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masenf/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masenf/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"When shared-cookie sync adopts a login popup's tokens before its `post_auth` message arrives, the embedded opener's matching-token shortcut returns without navigating. The child can remain on `/login` with its protected event still pending. Complete the validated return redirect when the matching tokens are valid, allowing the destination's page-load guard to replay the action once while avoiding redundant token writes and audit emissions.\n\nAdds unit coverage for matching tokens with and without refresh tokens, rejected tokens, and redirect validation; browser coverage checks normal login and a deterministic cookie-before-message ordering, automatic child navigation, one replay, and pending storage cleanup. Cookie-handler registration is reset between temporary test apps. Includes a bugfix changelog fragment.\n\nFixes #253.\n\nValidation:\n- Auth unit tests: 501 passed, 2 skipped on Reflex 0.9.12; 502 passed, 1 skipped on the newer Reflex API.\n- Browser matrix: 6 passed on each environment, covering default scopes and `offline_access`. The deterministic pending-replay case fails against the original source.\n- All commit hooks passed: Ruff formatting/lint, codespell, stub generation, and Pyright.","created_at":"2026-10-06T03:02:15Z","updated_at":"2026-10-06T04:24:28Z","closed_at":"2026-10-06T04:24:17Z","merged_at":"2026-10-06T04:24:17Z","merge_commit_sha":"8b060bcca817fb9efe4237fe107d75c91b776f93","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reflex-dev/reflex-enterprise/pulls/256/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reflex-dev/reflex-enterprise/pulls/256/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reflex-dev/reflex-enterprise/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reflex-dev/reflex-enterprise/issues/256/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reflex-dev/reflex-enterprise/statuses/16e8c0aae44e0972d41ee61e4185c350ab9942be","head":{"label":"reflex-dev:codex/fix-iframe-popup-replay","ref":"codex/fix-iframe-popup-replay","sha":"16e8c0aae44e0972d41ee61e4185c350ab9942be","user":{"login":"reflex-dev","id":104714959,"node_id":"O_kgDOBj3Szw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/104714959?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reflex-dev","html_url":"https://github.com/reflex-dev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reflex-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.